{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51496","headline":"伤贾岛无可（《全唐诗》五九○收此诗，文字异同较多，故重录） · 李郢","name":"伤贾岛无可（《全唐诗》五九○收此诗，文字异同较多，故重录）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却到城中（《全唐诗》作「京师」）事事伤。\n惠休归去（寂）贾生亡。\n谁人收得章句（文章）箧。\n独我重（来）经苔藓房。\n一命未沾爲逐客。\n万缘初尽别空王。\n萧萧竹坞残（斜）阳在。\n叶拂（覆）闲堦雪拥墙。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}